    "body": "<header>\n<h1 data-aid=\"128475662\" id=\"title1\"><strong>Jesus Christ, Crucifixion of</strong></h1>\n</header>\n<div class=\"body-block\">\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul class=\"reference\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"title\" data-aid=\"128475663\" id=\"title2\"><em>See also</em> <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/jesus-christ-death-of?lang=eng\">Jesus Christ, Death of</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475664\" id=\"p1\">my God, why hast thou <span class=\"key-word\">forsaken</span> me, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/ps/22?lang=eng&amp;id=p1#p1\">Ps. 22:1</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/mark/15?lang=eng&amp;id=p34#p34\">Mark 15:34</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475665\" id=\"p2\">they <span class=\"key-word\">pierced</span> my hands and my feet, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/ps/22?lang=eng&amp;id=p16#p16\">Ps. 22:16</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475666\" id=\"p3\">poured out his soul unto <span class=\"key-word\">death</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/53?lang=eng&amp;id=p12#p12\">Isa. 53:12</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/14?lang=eng&amp;id=p12#p12\">Mosiah 14:12</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475667\" id=\"p4\">they shall look upon me whom they have <span class=\"key-word\">pierced</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/zech/12?lang=eng&amp;id=p10#p10\">Zech. 12:10</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/19?lang=eng&amp;id=p37#p37\">John 19:37</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475668\" id=\"p5\">What are these <span class=\"key-word\">wounds</span> in thine hands, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/zech/13?lang=eng&amp;id=p6#p6\">Zech. 13:6</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475669\" id=\"p6\">to mock, and to scourge, and to <span class=\"key-word\">crucify</span> him, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/20?lang=eng&amp;id=p19#p19\">Matt. 20:19</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/2-ne/6?lang=eng&amp;id=p9#p9\">2 Ne. 6:9</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p9#p9\">Mosiah 3:9</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475670\" id=\"p7\">Son of man is betrayed to be <span class=\"key-word\">crucified</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/26?lang=eng&amp;id=p2#p2\">Matt. 26:2</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475671\" id=\"p8\">Let him be <span class=\"key-word\">crucified</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/27?lang=eng&amp;id=p22#p22\">Matt. 27:22</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/luke/23?lang=eng&amp;id=p23#p23\">Luke 23:23</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475672\" id=\"p9\">they <span class=\"key-word\">crucified</span> him, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/27?lang=eng&amp;id=p35#p35\">Matt. 27:35</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/mark/15?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">Mark 15:15</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/19?lang=eng&amp;id=p16#p16\">John 19:16</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475673\" id=\"p10\">ye seek Jesus, which was <span class=\"key-word\">crucified</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/28?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">Matt. 28:5</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/mark/16?lang=eng&amp;id=p6#p6\">Mark 16:6</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475674\" id=\"p11\">Son of man … must <span class=\"key-word\">suffer</span> many things, and be set at nought, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/mark/9?lang=eng&amp;id=p12#p12\">Mark 9:12</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/mark/9?lang=eng&amp;id=p31#p31\">9:31</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475675\" id=\"p12\">cried out again, <span class=\"key-word\">Crucify</span> him, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/mark/15?lang=eng&amp;id=p13#p13\">Mark 15:13</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/19?lang=eng&amp;id=p6%2Cp15#p6\">John 19:6, 15</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475676\" id=\"p13\">Calvary, there they <span class=\"key-word\">crucified</span> him, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/luke/23?lang=eng&amp;id=p33#p33\">Luke 23:33</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475677\" id=\"p14\">condemned to death, and have <span class=\"key-word\">crucified</span> him, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/luke/24?lang=eng&amp;id=p20#p20\">Luke 24:20</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475678\" id=\"p15\">if I be <span class=\"key-word\">lifted</span> up from the earth, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/12?lang=eng&amp;id=p32#p32\">John 12:32</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/1-ne/11?lang=eng&amp;id=p33#p33\">1 Ne. 11:33</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/1-ne/19?lang=eng&amp;id=p10#p10\">19:10</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/pgp/moses/7?lang=eng&amp;id=p55#p55\">Moses 7:55</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475679\" id=\"p16\">knowest thou not that I have power to <span class=\"key-word\">crucify</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/19?lang=eng&amp;id=p10#p10\">John 19:10</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475680\" id=\"p17\">bodies should not remain upon the <span class=\"key-word\">cross</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/19?lang=eng&amp;id=p31#p31\">John 19:31</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/deut/21?lang=eng&amp;id=p23#p23\">Deut. 21:23</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475681\" id=\"p18\">I shall see in his hands the <span class=\"key-word\">print</span> of the nails, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/20?lang=eng&amp;id=p25#p25\">John 20:25</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475682\" id=\"p19\">by wicked hands have <span class=\"key-word\">crucified</span> and slain, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/acts/2?lang=eng&amp;id=p23#p23\">Acts 2:23</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/15?lang=eng&amp;id=p7#p7\">Mosiah 15:7</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475683\" id=\"p20\">same Jesus, whom ye have <span class=\"key-word\">crucified</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/acts/2?lang=eng&amp;id=p36#p36\">Acts 2:36</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475684\" id=\"p21\">whom ye <span class=\"key-word\">crucified</span>, whom God raised from the dead, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/acts/4?lang=eng&amp;id=p10#p10\">Acts 4:10</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475685\" id=\"p22\">Jesus, whom ye slew and <span class=\"key-word\">hanged</span> on a tree, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/acts/5?lang=eng&amp;id=p30#p30\">Acts 5:30</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475686\" id=\"p23\">we preach Christ <span class=\"key-word\">crucified</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-cor/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p23#p23\">1 Cor. 1:23</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475687\" id=\"p24\">not to know any thing … save Jesus Christ, and him <span class=\"key-word\">crucified</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-cor/2?lang=eng&amp;id=p2#p2\">1 Cor. 2:2</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475688\" id=\"p25\">they would not have <span class=\"key-word\">crucified</span> the Lord, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-cor/2?lang=eng&amp;id=p8#p8\">1 Cor. 2:8</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475689\" id=\"p26\">though he was <span class=\"key-word\">crucified</span> through weakness, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/2-cor/13?lang=eng&amp;id=p4#p4\">2 Cor. 13:4</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475690\" id=\"p27\">world is <span class=\"key-word\">crucified</span> unto me, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/gal/6?lang=eng&amp;id=p14#p14\">Gal. 6:14</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475691\" id=\"p28\"><span class=\"key-word\">crucify</span> to themselves the Son of God afresh, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/heb/6?lang=eng&amp;id=p6#p6\">Heb. 6:6</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475692\" id=\"p29\">where also our Lord was <span class=\"key-word\">crucified</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/rev/11?lang=eng&amp;id=p8#p8\">Rev. 11:8</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475693\" id=\"p30\">they had <span class=\"key-word\">slain</span> the Messiah, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/1-ne/10?lang=eng&amp;id=p11#p11\">1 Ne. 10:11</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475694\" id=\"p31\">stiffen their necks against him, that he be <span class=\"key-word\">crucified</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/2-ne/10?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">2 Ne. 10:5</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475695\" id=\"p32\">they will <span class=\"key-word\">crucify</span> him, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/2-ne/25?lang=eng&amp;id=p13#p13\">2 Ne. 25:13</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475696\" id=\"p33\">he was <span class=\"key-word\">wounded</span> for our transgressions, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/14?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">Mosiah 14:5</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475697\" id=\"p34\">prints of the <span class=\"key-word\">nails</span> in my hands and feet, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/6?lang=eng&amp;id=p37#p37\">D&amp;C 6:37</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475698\" id=\"p35\">He was <span class=\"key-word\">crucified</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/20?lang=eng&amp;id=p23#p23\">D&amp;C 20:23</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475699\" id=\"p36\">Jesus was <span class=\"key-word\">crucified</span> by sinful men, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/21?lang=eng&amp;id=p9#p9\">D&amp;C 21:9</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475700\" id=\"p37\"><span class=\"key-word\">crucified</span> for the sins of the world, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/35?lang=eng&amp;id=p2#p2\">D&amp;C 35:2</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/46?lang=eng&amp;id=p13#p13\">46:13</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/53?lang=eng&amp;id=p2#p2\">53:2</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/54?lang=eng&amp;id=p1#p1\">54:1</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475701\" id=\"p38\">I am Jesus that was <span class=\"key-word\">crucified</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/45?lang=eng&amp;id=p52#p52\">D&amp;C 45:52</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475702\" id=\"p39\">Jesus, to be <span class=\"key-word\">crucified</span> for the world, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/76?lang=eng&amp;id=p41#p41\">D&amp;C 76:41</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475703\" id=\"p40\">time intervening between the <span class=\"key-word\">crucifixion</span> and his resurrection, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/138?lang=eng&amp;id=p27#p27\">D&amp;C 138:27</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475704\" id=\"p41\">sacrifice of the Son of God upon the <span class=\"key-word\">cross</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/138?lang=eng&amp;id=p35#p35\">D&amp;C 138:35</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul class=\"reference\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"title\" data-aid=\"128475705\" id=\"title3\"><em>See also</em> <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/deut/21?lang=eng&amp;id=p23#p23\">Deut. 21:23</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/dan/9?lang=eng&amp;id=p26#p26\">Dan. 9:26</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/gal/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p1#p1\">Gal. 3:1</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n</div>",
